{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is a simple, snappily paced experience which forces you to quickly formulate coherent responses to your new neighbor's almost interrogatory questions in real time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/TheosSexyPose.png?t=1743805283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As you keep the conversation flowing, study your host's body language for any sign of irritation while remembering to keep your own physical mannerisms in check.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Depending on your social skills you may be able to leave the table good friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Or you might become another secret he'll have to hide from a future dinner guest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/CallThisNumber.png?t=1743805283\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is designed specifically to be played on computer with a keyboard and requires every key to be working properly in order to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please only play the game if it's running at a smooth framerate to avoid any potential softlocks or sequence breaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thanks For The Steak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543000/bcd06bd61ceefbb7e76bf7c982b3c335fca19c97.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks For The Pie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543000/b69113f68c3f986695dc9c1fc71e292f61e94825.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks For Th